{
  "_readme": [
    "Machine-local overlay for content-stacks/standalone.json. Copy this file to",
    "'standalone.local.json' (git-ignored) and edit the paths. The loader applies it",
    "automatically whenever it reads standalone.json.",
    "",
    "This is the producer/consumer rendezvous: Minosoft (consumer) points a source at",
    "a local handoff directory that Blockbench + automation (producer) writes generated",
    "content into. Only a source's resolvable fields may be retargeted here (default",
    "path, environment key, optional flag), keyed by the source 'label' from",
    "standalone.json. Source order, type, label, artifact, and multiple stay",
    "source-controlled and cannot be overridden.",
    "",
    "Labels available in standalone.json: generated-compatibility, voxelibre-base,",
    "managed-mod-assets, local-mod-assets, loose-content, standalone-content-notices,",
    "faithful-32x, vanilla-evolved, open-assets-lib, gui-revision, local-resource-packs,",
    "faithful-overlays."
  ],
  "schema": 1,
  "overrides": {
    "loose-content": {
      "default": "/absolute/path/to/blockbench-producer/out/resourcepack"
    },
    "generated-compatibility": {
      "default": "/absolute/path/to/local/content-audit-stages"
    }
  }
}
